    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Goetic Summoner</strong></p><p><strong>“The monster is defeated. Good. Now sign here.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 4, you stop acting like the Darkness is weather. You treat it like an army.</p><p>You can attempt to bind a major Qliphothic entity your faction has defeated and turn it into an asset. This is not safe. It is useful.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Major Binding:</strong> after your faction defeats a major Qliphothic entity in a Scenario, you may attempt to bind it</li><li>Spend <strong>10 Intrigue OP</strong>, then make an appropriate Strategic Roll as adjudicated by the GM</li><li>On success: gain a bound entity asset that grants <strong>+5 to Violence or Intrigue OP rolls</strong> (choose one) while it remains bound</li><li>On failure: the entity escapes with a grudge, and the fallout becomes a Campaign problem</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> while the entity remains bound, regional <strong>Darkness pressure escalates</strong>. This is the price of keeping a predator on a leash.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"goeticT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Major Binding</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic (10 Mind) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">After defeating a major Qliphothic entity: spend 10 Intrigue OP, GM-adjudicated roll. Success: bound asset (+5 Vio or Mind rolls). Failure: entity escapes with a grudge.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
